---
// The homepage centerpiece: the Kaspa programmability stack, every box a link.
---
<figure class="diagram">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 760 400"
    role="img"
    aria-label="The Kaspa stack: consensus at the bottom, Kaspa Script and Covenants above it, Silverscript compiles to that, Argent builds on Silverscript, and apps such as KCC-20 tokens sit on top. vProgs is a dashed roadmap box beside the stack."
  >
    <!-- Apps row -->
    <rect x="36" y="20" width="430" height="56" rx="8" class="row r5" />
    <a href="/stack/kcc-20"><rect x="46" y="30" width="112" height="36" rx="6" class="chip-box" /><text x="102" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="t-chip">KCC-20</text></a>
    <a href="/learn/how-it-fits-together"><rect x="168" y="30" width="140" height="36" rx="6" class="chip-box" /><text x="238" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="t-chip">vaults · escrow</text></a>
    <a href="/compare"><rect x="318" y="30" width="138" height="36" rx="6" class="chip-box" /><text x="387" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="t-chip">your project</text></a>

    <!-- Argent -->
    <a href="/stack/argent">
      <rect x="36" y="96" width="430" height="56" rx="8" class="row r4" />
      <text x="56" y="121" class="t-name">Argent</text>
      <text x="56" y="139" class="t-sub">app language · actors + ICC</text>
    </a>

    <!-- Silverscript -->
    <a href="/stack/silverscript">
      <rect x="36" y="172" width="430" height="56" rx="8" class="row r3" />
      <text x="56" y="197" class="t-name">Silverscript</text>
      <text x="56" y="215" class="t-sub">covenant language</text>
    </a>

    <!-- Kaspa Script + Covenants -->
    <a href="/stack/kaspa-script">
      <rect x="36" y="248" width="430" height="56" rx="8" class="row r2" />
      <text x="56" y="273" class="t-name">Kaspa Script + Covenants++</text>
      <text x="56" y="291" class="t-sub">KIP-17 lineage · KIP-20 covenant ids · tx v1 · inline ZK</text>
    </a>

    <!-- Consensus -->
    <a href="/learn/kaspa-in-60-seconds">
      <rect x="36" y="324" width="430" height="56" rx="8" class="row r1" />
      <text x="56" y="349" class="t-name">Kaspa consensus</text>
      <text x="56" y="367" class="t-sub">GHOSTDAG · blockDAG · proof of work</text>
    </a>

    <!-- interlayer ticks -->
    <line x1="251" y1="76" x2="251" y2="94" class="tick" />
    <line x1="251" y1="152" x2="251" y2="170" class="tick" />
    <line x1="251" y1="228" x2="251" y2="246" class="tick" />
    <text x="261" y="242" class="t-note">compiles to</text>
    <line x1="251" y1="304" x2="251" y2="322" class="tick" />

    <!-- vProgs roadmap -->
    <a href="/stack/vprogs">
      <rect x="516" y="248" width="208" height="56" rx="8" class="roadmap" />
      <text x="536" y="273" class="t-name dim">vProgs / CDAG</text>
      <text x="536" y="291" class="t-sub">roadmap — native DAG programs</text>
    </a>
    <line x1="466" y1="276" x2="514" y2="276" class="dotted" />
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    Each layer rests on the one below: apps compile through Argent and Silverscript down to Kaspa Script,
    and consensus enforces the result. vProgs is the research track for native DAG programs.
    Click any box to open its page.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .diagram {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px 16px 12px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .diagram svg { max-width: 100%; height: auto; min-width: 620px; display: block; margin: 0 auto; }
  figcaption { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.82rem; text-align: center; margin-top: 10px; padding: 0 12px; }
  .row { stroke: var(--teal-dim); }
  .r1 { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 22%, transparent); }
  .r2 { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 17%, transparent); }
  .r3 { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 13%, transparent); }
  .r4 { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 9%, transparent); }
  .r5 { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 5%, transparent); }
  .chip-box { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 14%, transparent); stroke: var(--teal-dim); }
  .roadmap { fill: none; stroke: var(--faint); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .tick { stroke: var(--faint); }
  .dotted { stroke: var(--faint); stroke-dasharray: 2 4; }
  .t-name { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text); }
  .t-name.dim { fill: var(--muted); }
  .t-sub { font-family: 'Instrument Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; fill: var(--muted); }
  .t-chip { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text); }
  .t-note { font-family: 'Instrument Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; fill: var(--faint); }
  svg a:hover rect { stroke: var(--teal); }
  svg a:hover .t-name, svg a:hover .t-chip { fill: var(--teal-bright); }
</style>
